Font Awesome Free 7.3.1
=======================

The Font Awesome SVG assets under assets/icons/fontawesome-free-7.3.1
are from Font Awesome Free 7.3.1 by Fonticons, Inc. The solid icons are sourced
from:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome/7.3.1/svgs/solid/
