Chromium cursor resources
=========================

The cursor files under assets/cursors are base64-encoded copies of official
Chromium cursor resources:

https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/ui/resources/cursors/

They are used for Windows drag and browser autoscroll cursor bridges.
Chromium source files are distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license:

https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main/LICENSE

GPUI
====

The native UI is built with GPUI from Zed Industries:

https://github.com/zed-industries/zed

GPUI and the vendored Windows backend are licensed under Apache 2.0. The
vendored Zed license text is included in vendor/gpui_windows/LICENSE-APACHE.
Release packages include it as LICENSE-APACHE-ZED.

gpui-component
==============

Dropdowns, dialogs, and other widgets come from gpui-component, licensed
under Apache 2.0:

https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-component

The vendored Apache 2.0 license text is included in
vendor/gpui-component/LICENSE-APACHE and the crate-specific license files.
Release packages include this text as LICENSE-APACHE-GPUI-COMPONENT,
LICENSE-APACHE-GPUI-COMPONENT-UI, and
LICENSE-APACHE-GPUI-COMPONENT-MACROS.

